  "details": "If VRCObjectSync objects start disabled (for example: their parent object is disabled by default and later enabled through a toggle button) they don't properly sync with remote users for things such as it's Transform and Active state.\n\nThis started occurring with patch VRChat 2025.1.3 - one week prior this functionality was working.  World SDK ver. 3.7.5 used, however 3.7.7-beta.1 was tested and also shows the bug.",
